<title>USA: Iowa-So Minn hogs actual Monday 95,000 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-So Minn hogs actual Monday 95,000 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said Monday's actual 95,000 head. Opening trade was not well established. Early sales of barrows and gilts were $1.00 higher than mid-session Monday. Top $56.50 per cwt.</p>
<p>				Country		  Plants</p>
<p>US 1-3   46-49% Carcass Base Lean*</p>
<p>220-260 lbs		 54.00 -55.00	   55.00 -56.00</p>
<p>few			   53.50  55.50	   54.50  56.50</p>
<p>Sows - up $1.00-3.50. Top $55.50.</p>
<p>US 1-3 300-450 lbs.     42.00 -44.00	   43.00 -44.00</p>
<p>450-500 lbs.		46.00 -50.00	   47.00 -51.00</p>
<p>500 lbs. up		 50.00 -54.50	   50.00 -55.50</p>
